  "description_short": "Family-run farmstall on the N2 serving hearty country breakfasts and selling local produce.",
  "description_long": "Kontrei Farmstall sits just off the N2 outside George, offering travellers and locals a proper country stop. The breakfast menu runs from traditional farm-style platters to lighter options, all served in a relaxed setting with indoor and outdoor seating. Beyond the restaurant, the farmstall stocks local preserves, baked goods, and fresh produce from surrounding farms.\n\nKids can stretch their legs at the playground while parents browse the gift shop or pick up provisions for the road. It's the kind of place where you stop for a quick coffee and end up staying for a proper meal. The atmosphere is unpretentious and welcoming, with that genuine farmstall feel that's hard to find along busy routes.\n\nWhether you're breaking up a long drive or looking for a weekend breakfast spot away from town, Kontrei delivers honest country cooking without the fuss. The setting captures that Garden Route farm charm, and the mix of restaurant, market, and play area makes it work for families and road-trippers alike.",
